MSH ─ Message Header
 ├─ NTE (optional, repeating – general message comments)
 ├─ SFT (optional – system software info; sometimes omitted in 2.3.1)

PID ─ Patient Identification
 ├─ PD1 (optional – additional patient demographics)
 ├─ NTE (optional, repeating – patient comments)
 ├─ NK1 (optional, repeating – next of kin / associated parties)

PV1 ─ Patient Visit
 ├─ PV2 (optional – additional visit info)
 ├─ NTE (optional, repeating – visit-level notes)
 ├─ ROL (optional, repeating – practitioner or role info)
 ├─ DG1 (optional, repeating – diagnosis info)
 ├─ DRG (optional, repeating – diagnostic related group)
 ├─ AL1 (optional, repeating – allergy info)
 ├─ PR1 (optional, repeating – procedures)
 ├─ GT1 (optional, repeating – guarantor)
 ├─ IN1 (optional, repeating – insurance)
 │   ├─ IN2 (optional – additional insurance info)
 │   └─ IN3 (optional, repeating – certification info)
 ├─ ACC (optional – accident info)
 ├─ UB1 / UB2 (optional – billing data)
 └─ Z-segments (custom site-specific extensions)

ORC ─ Common Order (repeating group)
 ├─ NTE (optional, repeating – order-level notes)
 ├─ ROL (optional, repeating – role info)
 ├─ OBR (observation request, repeating group)
 │   ├─ NTE (optional, repeating – order notes)
 │   ├─ ROL (optional, repeating)
 │   ├─ OBX (observation result, repeating)
 │   │   ├─ NTE (optional, repeating – observation comments)
 │   ├─ TCD (optional – test code details)
 │   ├─ SPM (optional – specimen info)
 │   │   ├─ OBX (optional, repeating – specimen observation)
 │   │   │   └─ NTE (optional, repeating)
 │   ├─ SAC (optional, repeating – specimen containers)
 │   ├─ FT1 (optional, repeating – financial transactions)
 │   └─ Z-segments (optional – custom extensions)
 ├─ FT1 (optional, repeating)
 └─ Z-segments (optional)
OBX ─ Observation/Result (if not within OBR)
 ├─ NTE (optional, repeating – observation-level notes)

DG1 ─ Diagnosis (optional, repeating)
 ├─ NTE (optional, repeating – diagnosis-level notes)

AL1 ─ Allergy (optional, repeating)
 ├─ NTE (optional, repeating – allergy comments)

PR1 ─ Procedure (optional, repeating)
 ├─ NTE (optional, repeating – procedure comments)

GT1 ─ Guarantor (optional, repeating)
 ├─ NTE (optional, repeating – guarantor comments)

IN1 ─ Insurance (optional, repeating)
 ├─ IN2 (optional)
 ├─ IN3 (optional, repeating)
 └─ NTE (optional, repeating)

ACC ─ Accident (optional)
 ├─ NTE (optional, repeating)

UB1 ─ Universal Bill (optional)
UB2 ─ Universal Bill 2 (optional)
Zxx ─ Site-specific custom segment(s)
